Multiple inline style arrays create new references on every render. The `[styles.flex1]`, `[styles.flex1, styles.flexColumn, styles.justifyContentCenter, styles.alignItemsCenter]`, and `[styles.mh5]` arrays should be defined outside the component.

**Suggested fix:**
```typescript
const flex1Style = [styles.flex1];
const loadingContainerStyle = [styles.flex1, styles.flexColumn, styles.justifyContentCenter, styles.alignItemsCenter];
const listContentStyle = [styles.mh5];
```

